OL,3,AThe Pitt, Widow's Bay, Hacks among
OL,4,Aearly winners at Emmy Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaw & Order star Mariska Hargitay
OL,7,Fopened up the 78th Primetime Emmy
OL,8,FAwards with a celebrity-filled musical
OL,9,Fnumber - she's the first woman to host
OL,10,Fthe show in 15 years
OL,12,FActress Jean Smart won her eighth Emmy
OL,13,F- and fifth consecutive for the comedy
OL,14,Fseries Hacks - which tied her for the
OL,15,Fmost acting awards, while British
OL,16,Factress Kate O'Flynn got the first win
OL,17,Fof the night for Widow's Bay, telling
OL,18,FBBC her a message for those back home -
OL,19,F"to our family and friends, we did it!"
